# EXPECT: A property needs a range
# An object property that declares a domain but no range.
@prefix o4de: <http://www.zt4swe.io/o4de#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
o4de:badLink a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "bad link" ; rdfs:domain o4de:Process ; skos:definition "A link that is missing its range, which the shapes must refuse." .
